<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Aug 22 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1995/96		  1996/97</p>
<p> Mexico	 19,400	  Mexico  64,100</p>
<p> Honduras	3,000	  Unknown 52,000</p>
<p> Japan	 -16,200</p>
<p>Note: weekly exports of 91,400 tonnes were down 55 percent from the previous week's marketing year high and 22 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Japan, Mexico.</p>
</text>
